stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> READY: Init
    READY --> ADDED: ADD
    ADDED --> ADDED: ADD

    note right of READY
        +Init
        subscribe/addProduct ADD ($productId) <= ($productId)
    end note

    note right of ADDED
        #{productId} <= $productId
        effect/productAdded <= (productId)
    end note
